COMMENTS :
After many years of awful experiences
on P.O.W., Paranoes became experts in
chemical war. The first of them was
Doctor Engel Nikloz whose sick brain
gave the formula of a deadly gas of
which a single molecule could inflict
an instant death. In due course rocket
engineers adapted a special warhead on
a missile launcher with the undisguised
intention to use this new weapon on
ennemy populations.

